And we got a great giveaway.

268
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,000
We have some products from E-Lite

269
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:10,000
and E-Lite is a really kind of a cool new

270
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
electrolyte replacement product

271
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:17,000
And for a few drops from a concentrate

272
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,000
added to any bottle of water

273
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:24,000
is going to give you a great electrolyte replacement.

274
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:27,000
And if you listened back when we were talking

275
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:29,000
with Dr Auerbach in the interview-

276
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:34,000
I think it was podcast 58 or 57,

277
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,000
Dr Auerbach recommended this product

278
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,000
and I went and found out about it,

279
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:40,000
And E-Lite people were good enough to give us some samples

280
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:43,000
and to give us a kit that we are going to make

281
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,000
the newsletter giveaway this time.

282
